ShortDescription: Your Claude Code limits in the taskbar, when you will hit them at this pace, and which session needs you.
Description: |-
  A widget inside the Windows taskbar for Claude Code users: your 5-hour and weekly limits (or a monthly spend cap),
  when you would hit the limit at this pace, which Claude Code session is waiting for you, Codex's limits beside
  Claude's, and what today's sessions cost. Out of the box it reads the limits from Claude Code itself through a
  companion plugin and never touches your Claude sign-in.
